W: 1. LET hearts awaken, now the night is ended,
W: And raise their morning psalm of adoration,
W: In sweetest concert the Creator&apos;s glory
W: Joyfully singing.
W:
W: 2. So, with the anthems of the blest uniting,
W: May we find grace to win the courts celestial,
W: And hymn the praise of heaven’s high king eternal
W: Through life ending.
W:
W: 3. Grant this, O Father, Son, and Holy Spirit,
W: Trinity blessed, who are Godhead sharest:
W: Thine be the glory through the whole creation
W: Now and for eve</miscellaneous-field>
